{"case_id": "female_19830326_P006-Q30", "domain": "unknown", "question": "2019年开始，2021年结束，桃花类型、分手原因？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主癸水生于卯月，食神当令，年柱癸亥水旺，时柱戊午火土相克。2019年己亥，流年天干己土七杀透出，地支亥水与日支丑土拱合，且与年支亥水伏吟，感情上易有暗昧之事。2021年辛丑，流年天干辛金偏印生身，地支丑土与日支伏吟，且与月支卯木半合木局，木旺则水泄，感情波动明显。\n\n从桃花星看，日支丑土为夫宫，时支午火为桃花，午中藏丁火偏财，代表异性缘。2019-2021年期间，流年地支亥、丑与命局亥、卯、丑、午组合，形成亥卯未三合木局（未在命局中无，但亥卯半合），木为食伤，食伤旺则克制官杀（夫星），且时柱戊土正官被午火生，但午火为桃花，且戊土坐午为帝旺，暗示对方有家室或已有稳定关系。2021年辛丑，丑土伏吟夫宫，且丑午相害，主感情破裂，且丑为金库，辛金透出，偏印夺食，食伤受制，主因欺骗或隐瞒导致分手。\n\n综合判断，此段感情对象为已婚男，因欺骗（未离婚）而分手。故答案为B。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": null, "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_off", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "female_19830326_P006-Q30", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_off_r2_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4863, "response_id": "a7956135-bb59-43d5-bbba-9afce3b895be", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 267, "completion_tokens": 340, "total_tokens": 607, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 11}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "female_19800921_P007-Q33", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2017和2019年发生了什么事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱庚申、月柱乙酉、日柱丁酉、时柱乙巳。日主丁火生于酉月，金旺火弱，地支三金（申、酉、酉）耗火，时支巳火为根但被酉金合绊，整体身弱喜木火。\n\n2017年丁酉：流年天干丁火帮身，但地支酉金加重财星（金）力量，且与日支酉、月支酉形成三酉伏吟，金多克木（印星），且酉为丁火之偏财，财旺克印，主学业、文书、子女宫（时柱）受冲克。时柱乙巳，巳酉半合金局，子女宫动，但金旺克木（乙木为印星，代表子女的孕育），且丁火弱，易有生育方面问题。\n\n2019年己亥：流年天干己土食神，地支亥水正官，亥与月支酉、日支酉半会金局，金水更旺，亥水冲时支巳火（子女宫），且亥中甲木正印被金水耗，子女星（乙木）受克严重。流年己土食神代表子女，但被金泄、水耗，且亥巳冲，为子女宫逢冲，主流产或生育不顺。\n\n综合两年：2017年三酉伏吟，子女宫动但金旺克印；2019年子女宫逢冲，食神受制，均指向生育方面的意外，且无开刀（手术）明显标志（手术需金克木、火受制，但无强金克木之象），交通意外需驿马冲克，但此处更偏子女宫。流产可能性最大。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": null, "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_off", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "female_19800921_P007-Q33", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_off_r2_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5568, "response_id": "f41104ab-0aa9-4d61-abcd-68c46230ee1f", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 214, "completion_tokens": 391, "total_tokens": 605, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 86}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
